On Sat, 03 Nov 2007 23:53 Carl <carlhnelson@gmail.com> wrote:
> Everytime I connect (even with multiple sessions and the same
> character) with PuTTy to the dev/null servers I have to reset all of
> my options.  Is there some way to set them permanently on the server
> so that they come up automatically?

One solution is to create a text file that contains all
necessary keystrokes to set your preferred options.
For example to set OPTIONS=suppress_alert:3.4.3,msg_window:r,boulder:0,
your text file would look like this:

O>>>a
3.4.3

O>>f
r

O>>a
0

When you start a new game, just paste it and you're done.


